      why: `<p>Switch a coil on and its current can't jump: it rises along the same exponential curve as a charging capacitor, toward V ÷ R. With the flyback diode fitted, the current dies away along the same curve after switch-off.</p>`,
      use: `<p>Why relays take a few milliseconds to pull in and release, and why a flyback diode makes a relay release slightly more slowly.</p>`,
